    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>PAINTBALL MADNESS</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/1afe6b8d3be564508adab441a5e617aa.avif?t=1748872379\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 SPLASH HARD. MOVE FAST. RULE THE COLOR CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just paintball \u2014 it\u2019s a <strong>high-speed showdown in a world bursting with color</strong>.<br> Dive into <strong>wild, chaotic battles</strong> where every second is loud, bright, and full of action. One move can change everything. One shot can put you on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go solo or squad up \u2014 <strong>Paintball Madness\u2122</strong> drops you into <strong>vibrant, color-soaked battlegrounds</strong> where only the fastest, sharpest players come out on top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>EXPLORE THE MADNESS</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/2a96a21bd404ed5b1dcd1ce3669df07d.avif?t=1748872379\" width=613 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/976792abe00bc078f6dca554cde94b90.poster.avif?t=1748872379\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/976792abe00bc078f6dca554cde94b90.webm?t=1748872379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/976792abe00bc078f6dca554cde94b90.mp4?t=1748872379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into bold, color-packed arenas designed for chaos. From open-air layouts to tight corners and vertical routes, every zone fuels fast movement, tactical pushes, and non-stop paint-splattering fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/e10d10f7fa4fab0fe52ae1e0e933727f.avif?t=1748872379\" width=613 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/42846bdaa74ffbc6ddd807b74d271545.poster.avif?t=1748872379\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/42846bdaa74ffbc6ddd807b74d271545.webm?t=1748872379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/42846bdaa74ffbc6ddd807b74d271545.mp4?t=1748872379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take aim your way \u2014 lock in with first-person for precision shooting or switch to third-person for better map awareness. Play your style. Shift mid-fight. Always stay in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/3038617cc65647f01217eaee2c60ef30.avif?t=1748872379\" width=613 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/01b6c45fda64db35993e5432cd5e49ac.poster.avif?t=1748872379\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/01b6c45fda64db35993e5432cd5e49ac.webm?t=1748872379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/01b6c45fda64db35993e5432cd5e49ac.mp4?t=1748872379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay and outmaneuver with dynamic moves like dash, double jump, and a quick shield. Use them to escape ambushes, rush opponents, or turn the tide in close encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/108825a375885fda5ee7609de0364a4f.avif?t=1748872379\" width=613 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/c37a3898077be4d7b39ace6874c2abe5.poster.avif?t=1748872379\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/c37a3898077be4d7b39ace6874c2abe5.webm?t=1748872379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393780/extras/c37a3898077be4d7b39ace6874c2abe5.mp4?t=1748872379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every elimination drops coins. Pick them up, stack them up, and redeem later for skins and cosmetics on our website.<br> Your skill turns into style \u2014 the better you play, the better you look.<br> <strong>And soon, coins will matter even more \u2014 use them in tournaments and private matches to raise the stakes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd52 One Rule: Outscore Everyone Before the Game Ends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter the arena with one mission: <strong>get the most eliminations and outscore your opponents</strong>. <br> No camping. No hiding. No mercy. <br> <strong>Move fast, shoot smart, and stay on top</strong> if you want to win.<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udd25 FAST FUN FOR EVERYONE \u2014 BUT ONLY ONE WINS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Quick Matches</strong> \u2013 No warm-ups. No waiting. Just jump in and battle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Easy to Play, Tough to Master</strong> \u2013 Great for kids, teens, and seasoned shooter fans. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>FPS or TPS \u2013 Your Call</strong> \u2013 Swap between first- and third-person at any moment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Abilities That Flip the Fight</strong> \u2013 Dash, double jump, and shield your way to victory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3 <strong>No Time to Hide</strong> \u2013 Keep moving or fall behind. This game doesn\u2019t reward campers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Outplay, Outshoot, Outscore</strong> \u2013 Fast decisions and sharper aim make the difference. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd47 <strong>Live Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Track eliminations in real-time and fight to stay on top. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f DON\u2019T PLAY SAFE. PLAY TO WIN.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camping won\u2019t help. Hiding won\u2019t save you. <br> You want that <strong>#1 spot</strong>? Then you\u2019ve got to fight for it. <br> <strong>Outplay. Outshoot. Outspeed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f COMING SOON</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Tournaments</strong> \u2013 Compete in <strong>high-stakes events</strong> to prove you're the best and earn exclusive rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f <strong>Private Rooms</strong> \u2013 Create custom matches just for your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfab <strong>Game Pass System</strong> \u2013 Unlock exclusive cosmetics, rewards and host or join private matches with game passes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available in <strong>English</strong>.<br> More languages are coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 THE CLOCK IS TICKING. THE PAINT IS FLYING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move fast. Shoot smart. Rule the chaos.</strong> </p>",
