s</strong> to prove you're the best and earn exclusive rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f <strong>Private Rooms</strong> \u2013 Create custom matches just for your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfab <strong>Game Pass System</strong> \u2013 Unlock exclusive cosmetics, rewards and host or join private matches with game passes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available in <strong>English</strong>.<br> More languages are coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 THE CLOCK IS TICKING. THE PAINT IS FLYING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move fast. Shoot smart. Rule the chaos.</strong> </p>",
